        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This data type stores the leaf certificate, and all certificates in the chain up to the root. The root certificate is not included in this data type. In the special (but unlikely) case, that a leaf certificate is directly signed by the root, the \"SubCertificates\" field is empty. In all other cases, this field contains an ordered list of sub-CA-certificates to follow the trust-path from the leaf certificate up to the root. In addition to 8.3.5.3.3, this element may be signed, since an Id attribute is included.",
            "block_bbox": [
                67,
                701,
                1054,
                832
